# Example only — see docs/CONFIG.md
name: metal-mirage-shared
runtime: go
description: Traffic Manager failover + optional witness Function
# Required:
#   pulumi config set shared:primaryIngressIP '<primary ingress public IP>'
# If witness enabled (default):
#   pulumi config set shared:primaryAPIURL 'https://<api-ip>:6443/readyz'
# Optional:
#   pulumi config set shared:standbyFQDN '<aks fqdn>'
#   pulumi config set shared:enableWitness false
#   pulumi config set --secret shared:failoverWebhookURL 'https://…'  # optional; pair with ./scripts/failover-promote.sh
# Prefer: ./scripts/up.sh shared  (wires outputs from primary/standby)
# TM Azure names: profile metal-mirage-app, endpoints primary / standby
